  "contract": [
    "Read the selected TS188 stream through the recovery observer with the specified registered, private-audio, DVB subtitle or selected-AVC policy. Bind the observer from the real PAT and PMT. The reference reads the same PID with its MPEG-TS demuxer and disables the parser and field filling.",
    "Compare PID, projected PTS and DTS, carrier position, corrupt flag and all payload bytes for every packet, followed by kind 7 at clean EOF or kind 8 for a source/projection refusal. The demux clock is shared across packets and projects the encoded and diagnostic headers with their public APIs."
